---
/**
 * Host ↔ helper overview: the host daemon reaches every running instance
 * through one `exec -i … devsbd bridge` pipe, the bridge attaches to the
 * in-container `devsbd daemon` over `devsbd.ctl`, and the daemon owns the
 * sockets in-container tools use. In the landing diagrams' language
 * (`BabysitDiagram.astro`): purple the host daemon, cyan the container side,
 * lime you, green the ssh-agent, yellow notify. Desktop is one grid with
 * fixed rows (`--row`) so the arrows meet the cards; narrow screens stack it
 * and turn the arrows vertical.
 */
import { Bell, Binary, Cable, Container, KeyRound, Network, Server, Terminal, UserRound } from '@lucide/astro';
import '../../styles/architecture.css';

const sockets = [
  { name: 'ssh-agent.sock', mode: '0666' },
  { name: 'api.sock', mode: '0666' },
  { name: 'devsbd.ctl', mode: '0600' },
];

const serveParts = ['Bridges · event-driven poll', 'Forwards', 'API', 'Inbox sink'];
const hostEnds = [
  { icon: KeyRound, label: '$SSH_AUTH_SOCK', tone: 'agent' },
  { icon: Bell, label: 'inbox.json · popup', tone: 'notify' },
  { icon: Network, label: 'localhost:<port>', tone: 'helper' },
];
---

<figure class="arc-helper" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <p class="visually-hidden">
    Diagram. On the host, you run devsandbox commands or the dashboard, which talk JSON lines to the host daemon,
    devsandbox serve, over serve.sock. run and start also write the devsbd binary into the container at
    /run/devsandbox/bin/devsbd through exec stdin. The host daemon runs exec -i devsbd bridge in each running
    container; the bridge speaks length-prefixed frames on its stdio and attaches to the devsbd daemon over the
    devsbd.ctl socket. The daemon, running as root, owns ssh-agent.sock for ssh and git, api.sock for devsbd notify,
    ensure and events, and dials TCP inside the container for port forwards. The host daemon ends those streams at your
    ssh-agent, the Inbox store and desktop popups, and forward listeners on localhost.
  </p>

  <div class="arc-helper-grid" aria-hidden="true" inert>
    <div class="arc-zone arc-zone--host"></div>
    <div class="arc-zone arc-zone--box"></div>
    <div class="arc-zone-label arc-zone-label--host"><span>HOST</span> your machine</div>
    <div class="arc-zone-label arc-zone-label--box"><span>CONTAINER</span> devsandbox-web</div>

    <div class="arc-you"><UserRound /> CLI · dashboard</div>
    <div class="arc-link arc-link--right arc-h-install" data-tone="cli">
      <span>install</span>
      <small>exec -i · stdin</small>
    </div>
    <div class="arc-chip arc-h-binary">
      <Binary />/run/devsandbox/bin/devsbd
      <small>static musl · hash-checked</small>
    </div>

    <div class="arc-link arc-link--down arc-h-sock" data-tone="serve"><span>serve.sock · JSON lines</span></div>

    <div class="arc-card arc-card--serve arc-h-serve">
      <div class="arc-head">
        <span class="arc-icon"><Server /></span>
        <span class="arc-name">devsandbox serve</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arc-sub">setsid · one per user</div>
      <ul class="arc-tags">{serveParts.map((p) => <li>{p}</li>)}</ul>
    </div>

    <div class="arc-link arc-link--right arc-link--both arc-h-pipe" data-tone="serve">
      <span>exec -i -u root devsbd bridge</span>
      <small>frames on stdin/stdout</small>
    </div>

    <div class="arc-card arc-h-bridge">
      <div class="arc-head">
        <span class="arc-icon"><Cable /></span>
        <span class="arc-name">devsbd bridge</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arc-sub">per host process · copies bytes</div>
    </div>

    <div class="arc-link arc-link--right arc-link--both arc-h-ctl" data-tone="helper"><span>devsbd.ctl</span></div>

    <div class="arc-card arc-card--daemon arc-h-daemon">
      <div class="arc-head">
        <span class="arc-icon"><Container /></span>
        <span class="arc-name">devsbd daemon</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arc-sub">root · one per container, per build</div>
      <ul class="arc-sockets">
        {
          sockets.map((s) => (
            <li>
              {s.name}
              <i>{s.mode}</i>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="arc-link arc-link--left arc-h-l-agent" data-tone="agent"><span>ssh-agent.sock</span></div>
    <div class="arc-client arc-h-c-agent"><Terminal /><span>ssh · git push<small>SSH_AUTH_SOCK</small></span></div>
    <div class="arc-link arc-link--left arc-h-l-api" data-tone="notify"><span>api.sock</span></div>
    <div class="arc-client arc-h-c-api"><Bell /><span>devsbd notify · ensure<small>outbox · control</small></span></div>
    <div class="arc-link arc-link--right arc-h-l-tcp" data-tone="helper"><span>TCP dial</span></div>
    <div class="arc-client arc-h-c-tcp"><Network /><span>web:3000 · postgres<small>Connect streams</small></span></div>

    <div class="arc-link arc-link--down arc-h-ends" data-tone="serve"><span>streams end at</span></div>
    <ul class="arc-ends arc-h-endlist">
      {
        hostEnds.map((e) => (
          <li data-tone={e.tone}>
            <e.icon />
            {e.label}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</figure>
